  "limitations": [
    "The three cards are complete-system research profiles with one shared LATTE HIBE; they are not three independent HIBE algorithms.",
    "Their security groups and concrete targets are not established as equivalent, so measured medians and sizes are descriptive rather than a same-security ranking.",
